WEBVTT

00:06:26.716 --> 00:06:30.186
questioning whether,
"Is it something about me?"

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:32.122
"What is it about my group?"

00:06:32.155 --> 00:06:38.929
to the shift in understanding that society
is seeing and treating you differently,

00:06:38.929 --> 00:06:42.399
and that causes anger,
and that causes frustration.

00:06:43.099 --> 00:06:46.603
The problem with this is,
at the physiological level,

00:06:46.636 --> 00:06:48.171
it's still stress,

00:06:48.204 --> 00:06:49.639
and stress is debilitating.

00:06:49.639 --> 00:06:51.207
It keeps us up at night.

00:06:51.241 --> 00:06:52.642
It keeps us overeating.

00:06:52.676 --> 00:06:54.044
It keeps us undereating.

00:06:54.077 --> 00:06:58.214
You look at the early onset
of cardiovascular disease.

00:06:58.248 --> 00:07:00.817
The problem is, stress is debilitating.